ons, with a focus on improving overall health and nutritional status.\n\nDietoterapia also encompasses the use of diet in the treatment of diseases, including cancer prevention and management, and considers the impact of dietary factors such as sugar intake on weight and dental health. It is a vital aspect of nutrition and health, particularly in clinical settings where patients may require specialized dietary interventions, including parenteral nutrition in certain scenarios.\n\nOverall, Dietoterapia represents a holistic approach to dietary therapy, emphasizing the importance of nutrition in managing health conditions and improving patient outcomes.", "GINEBRA:Ginebra es una ciudad en Suiza, sede de la Organización Mundial de la Salud, donde se realizan importantes reuniones sobre salud global.", "JA HURTADO SUAZO:JA Hurtado Suazo es un autor que ha contribuido a la literatura sobre nutrición durante la gestación y lactancia.", "MA KOMINIAREK:MA Kominiarek es un autor que ha escrito sobre recomendaciones nutricionales en el embarazo y la lactancia.", "M:M es un autor que ha investigado sobre la nutrición y el yodo durante el embarazo y la lactancia.", "YODURO POTÁSICO:El yoduro potásico es un suplemento de yodo recomendado durante la gestación para asegurar un adecuado nivel de yodo en la madre y el feto.", "NUTRICIÓN DURANTE LA GESTACIÓN:La nutrición durante la gestación se refiere a las recomendaciones y prácticas alimenticias que deben seguir las mujeres embarazadas para asegurar la salud del feto.", "FÁRMACOS ANTICONVULSIVOS:", "INGESTAS DIETÉTICAS DE REFERENCIA:Ingestas Dietéticas de Referencia (IDR) are dietary reference intakes specifically developed for Spain and published in 2010. These guidelines serve as a framework for dietary recommendations aimed at the Spanish population, providing essential information on the intake of various nutrients. Among the nutrients addressed in the IDR are vitamin D and calcium, highlighting the importance of these elements in the diet. Overall, the IDR represents a comprehensive approach to ensuring adequate nutrition and health for individuals in Spain.", "CUÉLLAR OLMEDO LA:Cuéllar Olmedo LA is an author recognized for contributions to the literature on enteral nutrition, particularly focusing on its administration methods. Their work is referenced in discussions surrounding the practices and guidelines related to enteral nutrition, highlighting their significance in this field.", "TERROBA LARUMBE C:Terroba Larumbe C is an author who contributed to the literature on enteral nutrition.", "CORDERO VAQUERO AA:Cordero Vaquero AA is an author recognized for contributions to the literature on enteral nutrition, particularly focusing on its administration methods. Their work is referenced in discussions surrounding the practices and techniques involved in enteral nutrition, highlighting their significance in this field.", "DE LUIS ROMÁN DA:De Luis Román DA is an author recognized for his contributions to the field of nutrition, specifically in the areas of enteral and parenteral nutrition. He has been referenced in discussions regarding the administration methods of enteral nutrition, highlighting his expertise in this area. Additionally, De Luis Román DA has addressed the complications associated with parenteral nutrition, further demonstrating his comprehensive understanding of nutritional practices. His work has significantly contributed to the literature on enteral nutrition, establishing him as a notable figure in this domain.", "MUTUAL NUTRITION:The event of mutual nutrition refers to the process of providing nutritional support to patients who cannot meet their caloric needs orally, particularly in post-operative settings.", "HEAD AND NECK SURGERY:Head and neck surgery refers to surgical procedures performed on the head and neck region, often requiring nutritional support due to the complexity and recovery involved.", "GASTROINTESTINAL SURGERY:Gastrointestinal surgery involves surgical procedures on the digestive tract, which may necessitate enteral nutrition for recovery and healing."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}